#: kproxydlg.cpp:154
msgid "Use &Cache"
msgstr "Користење каса"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:156
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will use its cache to display recently "
"loaded web pages again. It is advisable to use the cache, as it makes "
"switching back and forth between web pages a lot faster. The disadvantage is "
"that it takes up disk space."
msgstr ""

