#: kproxydlg.cpp:168
msgid ""
"This is the average size in KB that the cache will take on your hard disk. "
"Once in a while the oldest pages will be deleted from the cache to reduce it "
"to this size."
msgstr ""

#: kproxydlg.cpp:191
msgid ""
"Click this button to copy the values for the HTTP proxy server to the fields "
"for the FTP proxy server, if you have one proxy for both protocols."
msgstr ""
"На ова копче се копираат вредностите за "
"HTTP proxy сервер кај вредностите за FTP proxy "
"сервер, доколку сакате еден ист за двата "
"протокола."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:230
msgid ""
"This module lets you configure your proxy and cache settings. A proxy is a "
"program on another computer that receives requests from your machine to "
"access a certain web page (or other Internet ressources), retrieves the page "
"and sends it back to you.<br>Proxies can help increase network throughput, "
"but can also be a means of controlling which web pages you access. The  "
"cache is an internal memory in Konqueror where recently read web pages are "
"stored. If you want to retrieve a web page again that you have recently "
"read, it will not be downloaded from the net, but rather retrieved from the "
"cache which is a lot faster."
msgstr ""

